{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\"><transition event=\"go\" target=\"f\"/></state><final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml001-missing-namespace.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml001-missing-namespace.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":6,"endColumn":7,"endLine":1,"startColumn":7,"startLine":1},"insertedContent":{"text":" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\""}}]}],"description":{"text":"declare the SCXML namespace"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml001-missing-namespace.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":7,"endLine":1,"startColumn":2,"startLine":1}}}],"message":{"markdown":"root element must be `scxml` in the W3C SCXML namespace\n\n**Note:** SCXML processors identify documents by the exact expanded name {http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml}scxml; a missing, misspelled, or slash-terminated namespace is a different vocabulary\n\n**Help:** declare the SCXML namespace: `<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\">`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.2 <scxml>","text":"root element must be `scxml` in the W3C SCXML namespace"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":6,"start":1},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML processors identify documents by the exact expanded name {http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml}scxml; a missing, misspelled, or slash-terminated namespace is a different vocabulary"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: use `<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\">` as the document element.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.2 <scxml>\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML001` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#scxml","id":"SCXML001","name":"SCXML001","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the root element is not `<scxml>` in the SCXML namespace"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}